Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Exercise notice pause through middleware and
 cold-session scheduling

Proof: canonical 12 tests pass. Real throughput middleware probe passes; reverting eligibility alone keeps the first request held until fixture release and fails paused_for_update. Auto-continue opt-out retains execution; recovered notice preserves full root prompt and attempt budget. Cold-session scheduling is covered, not real process restart yet.
